# The README's tour: an HTML mail and an invitation in the Preview, a
# Thread read full screen, then a Search completed from its menu.
Output assets/tour.gif
Source demo/tapes/setup.tape

Type "g"
Sleep 500ms
Show
Sleep 1.2s
Set TypingSpeed 250ms
Type "jjj"
Sleep 2.2s
Type "jjjj"
Sleep 2.2s
Type "gj"
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Sleep 2.2s
Escape
Sleep 900ms
Type "/"
Sleep 600ms
Set TypingSpeed 220ms
Type "is:u"
Sleep 900ms
Tab
Sleep 2s
Escape
Sleep 2s
